  "verses": [
    {
      "num": 1,
      "geez": "ወሄኖክ፡ ኀሊፎ፡ ይቤሎ፡ ለአዛዝኤል፡ ኢይከውነከ፡ ሰላም፡ ዐቢይ፡ ኵነኔ፡ ወፅአ፡ ላዕሌከ፡ ይስዕርከ።",
      "translation": "And Enoch went and said: ‘Azâzêl, thou shalt have no peace: a severe sentence has gone forth against thee to put thee in bonds:",
